# Unified MaCod Cloud resource values — single source of truth for the
# seeder scripts, the D1 migration wrapper, the R2 CORS setup, and the
# storefront deploy helper.
#
# Copy this file to .env at the repo root and fill in YOUR values.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real values.
#
# Precedence for every key: process.env > .env > built-in default.
#
#   MACOD_ACCOUNT_ID         — Cloudflare account ID (dashboard → account menu)
#   MACOD_DB_NAME            — D1 database name (wrangler d1 create <name>)
#   MACOD_R2_BUCKET_NAME     — R2 bucket name (wrangler r2 bucket create <name>)
#   MACOD_SERVER_URL         — deployed macod-server origin (storefront fetches this).
#                            Defaults to http://localhost:8787 for local dev;
#                            the storefront deploy refuses to ship a localhost
#                            value unless you pass --force-local.
#   MACOD_MEDIA_DOMAIN       — R2 custom domain, e.g. media.yourdomain.com

# MACOD_ACCOUNT_ID=
# MACOD_DB_NAME=macod-os-db
# MACOD_R2_BUCKET_NAME=macod-images
# MACOD_SERVER_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# MACOD_MEDIA_DOMAIN=media.yourdomain.com
